#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:5
msgid ""
"We're excited to announce the official vLLM Ascend v0.23.0 release, aligned "
"with upstream vLLM v0.23.0. This note summarizes the cumulative user-facing "
"changes since the previous official release, v0.18.0, including the "
"v0.19.1rc1, v0.20.2rc1, v0.21.0rc1, v0.22.1rc1, and v0.23.0rc1 development "
"cycles. Please follow the [official "
"documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.23.0/) to get "
"started."
msgstr ""
"我们很高兴地宣布官方 vLLM Ascend v0.23.0 版本发布，该版本与上游 vLLM v0.23.0 保持一致。本说明总结了自上一个官方版本 "
"v0.18.0 以来的累计用户可见变更，包括 v0.19.1rc1、v0.20.2rc1、v0.21.0rc1、v0.22.1rc1 和 "
"v0.23.0rc1 "
"开发周期。请参阅[官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.23.0/)以开始使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:7
msgid ""
"PR references marked with **†** were merged into the v0.23.0 release branch "
"after v0.23.0rc1."
msgstr "标记为 **†** 的 PR 引用是在 v0.23.0rc1 之后合并到 v0.23.0 发布分支中的。"

