#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:19
msgid ""
"Added multimodal DFlash, FlashComm support for Qwen VL/MoE models, and PCP-"
"aware multimodal reasoning. [#7486](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7486) [#7897](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7897) [#8038](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8038) [#9340](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9340)"
msgstr ""
"新增了多模态 DFlash、对 Qwen VL/MoE 模型的 FlashComm 支持，以及支持 PCP "
"感知的多模态推理。[#7486](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7486) "
"[#7897](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7897) "
"[#8038](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8038) "
"[#9340](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9340)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:20
msgid ""
"Added HCCL weight transfer for reinforcement-learning workloads and D2D "
"NetLoader support for speculative draft models. "
"[#9152](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9152) "
"[#9893](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9893)"
msgstr ""
"新增了用于强化学习工作负载的 HCCL 权重传输，以及用于投机草稿模型的 D2D NetLoader "
"支持。[#9152](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9152) "
"[#9893](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9893)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:21
msgid ""
"Expanded Model Runner V2 with initial MoE and Eagle support. "
"[#7885](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7885) "
"[#7922](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7922)"
msgstr ""
"扩展了 Model Runner V2，新增了初步的 MoE 和 Eagle 支持。[#7885](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7885) [#7922](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7922)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:22
msgid ""
"Expanded EPLB with additional observability and dynamic load-balancer "
"examples. [#9536](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9536) "
"[#10627](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10627)"
msgstr ""
"扩展了 EPLB，新增了额外的可观测性和动态负载均衡器示例。[#9536](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9536) [#10627](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10627)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:23
msgid ""
"Extended C8 INT8 KV cache to sparse-attention paths with packed layouts and "
"a DCP replicated indexer, and added W8A8FP8 and W4A16 MXFP quantization "
"paths for Ascend 950. [#10236](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10236) [#11014](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11014) [#11846](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11846) [#11871](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11871)"
msgstr ""
"将 C8 INT8 KV 缓存扩展到具有打包布局和 DCP 复制索引器的稀疏注意力路径，并为 Ascend 950 新增了 W8A8FP8 和 "
"W4A16 MXFP 量化路径。[#10236](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10236) [#11014](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11014) [#11846](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11846) [#11871](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11871)"

