#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:33
msgid ""
"Unless stated otherwise, these optimizations are selected automatically for "
"the targeted path and need no additional configuration."
msgstr "除非另有说明，这些优化会自动为目标路径选择，无需额外配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:35
msgid ""
"Replaced `npu_fusion_attention` with `_npu_flash_attention_unpad` for "
"supported A2/A3 attention workloads. It is selected automatically; no manual"
" setting is needed. [#8671](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8671)"
msgstr ""
"将受支持的A2/A3注意力工作负载中的`npu_fusion_attention`替换为`_npu_flash_attention_unpad`。该优化会自动选择，无需手动设置。[#8671](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8671)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:36
msgid ""
"Avoided projecting unused tail KV tokens during MLA prefill with PCP. Enable"
" PCP with `--prefill-context-parallel-size`; the optimization then applies "
"automatically. [#8787](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8787)"
msgstr ""
"在使用PCP进行MLA预填充时，避免投影未使用的尾部KV令牌。使用`--prefill-context-parallel-"
"size`启用PCP后，该优化会自动生效。[#8787](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8787)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:37
msgid ""
"Reduced scheduler issuance bubbles for workloads using asynchronous "
"scheduling. Enable it with `--async-scheduling`. "
"[#8766](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8766)"
msgstr ""
"减少了使用异步调度的工作负载中的调度器下发气泡。使用`--async-"
"scheduling`启用该功能。[#8766](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8766)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:38
msgid ""
"Added zero-bubble scheduling for asynchronous speculative decoding. Enable "
"it with `--async-scheduling` together with a speculative decoding "
"configuration. [#7640](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7640)"
msgstr ""
"为异步推测解码新增了零气泡调度。使用`--async-"
"scheduling`并配合推测解码配置即可启用。[#7640](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7640)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:39
msgid ""
"Batched KV-cache offload copies with `aclrtMemcpyBatchAsync` for CPU-offload"
" workloads. Configure KV cache CPU offload as documented; batching is "
"automatic within that path. [#7819](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7819)"
msgstr ""
"使用`aclrtMemcpyBatchAsync`对CPU卸载工作负载进行批量KV缓存卸载拷贝。按文档配置KV缓存CPU卸载后，该路径内会自动进行批处理。[#7819](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7819)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:40
msgid ""
"Reduced PCP/DCP KV-cache all-gather traffic by selecting the required blocks"
" before communication. Enable PCP or DCP with `--prefill-context-parallel-"
"size` or `--decode-context-parallel-size`; no separate optimization switch "
"is needed. [#8050](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8050)"
msgstr ""
"通过在通信前选择所需块，减少了PCP/DCP KV缓存全聚合流量。使用`--prefill-context-parallel-"
"size`或`--decode-context-parallel-"
"size`启用PCP或DCP即可，无需单独的优化开关。[#8050](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8050)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:41
msgid ""
"Optimized `split_qkv_tp_rmsnorm_rope` kernels for supported quantized model "
"paths. Kernel selection is automatic; no manual setting is needed. "
"[#8059](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8059) "
"[#9830](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9830)"
msgstr ""
"优化了受支持的量化模型路径中的`split_qkv_tp_rmsnorm_rope`内核。内核选择是自动的，无需手动设置。[#8059](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8059) [#9830](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9830)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:42
msgid ""
"Removed prefill host-device synchronization in Qwen3-Next and Qwen3.5 paths."
" It applies automatically to those models. [#7967](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7967)"
msgstr ""
"移除了Qwen3-Next和Qwen3.5路径中的预填充主机-"
"设备同步。该优化会自动应用于这些模型。[#7967](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7967)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:43
msgid ""
"Reduced SFA prefill KV all-gather communication for PCP/DCP. Enable the "
"corresponding context-parallel mode; the optimized communication path is "
"automatic. [#8043](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8043)"
msgstr ""
"减少了PCP/DCP的SFA预填充KV全聚合通信。启用相应的上下文并行模式后，优化后的通信路径会自动生效。[#8043](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8043)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:44
msgid ""
"Added a Triton penalty kernel for requests using repetition, frequency, or "
"presence penalties. It is selected automatically when penalties are "
"requested. [#7569](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7569)"
msgstr ""
"为使用重复、频率或存在惩罚的请求新增了Triton惩罚内核。当请求惩罚时，该内核会自动被选择。[#7569](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7569)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:45
msgid ""
"Optimized Model Runner V2 temperature and top-k log-softmax kernels. They "
"are selected automatically for sampling workloads on Model Runner V2. "
"[#8083](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8083)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Model Runner V2的温度和top-k log-softmax内核。对于Model Runner "
"V2上的采样工作负载，这些内核会自动被选择。[#8083](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8083)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:46
msgid ""
"Optimized the Model Runner V2 min-p kernel. It applies automatically when "
"min-p sampling is requested. [#8243](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8243) [#7767](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7767)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Model Runner V2的min-p内核。当请求min-"
"p采样时，该优化会自动生效。[#8243](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8243)"
" [#7767](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7767)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:47
msgid ""
"Added a Model Runner V2 Triton kernel for bad-word filtering. It applies "
"automatically when `bad_words` is supplied. [#8030](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8030)"
msgstr ""
"为不良词过滤新增了Model Runner V2 "
"Triton内核。当提供`bad_words`时，该内核会自动生效。[#8030](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8030)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:48
msgid ""
"Optimized the Model Runner V2 bincount kernel. It is selected automatically "
"for sampling paths that require token counts. "
"[#7757](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7757)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Model Runner "
"V2的bincount内核。对于需要令牌计数的采样路径，该内核会自动被选择。[#7757](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7757)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:49
msgid ""
"Optimized the Model Runner V2 ranks kernel. It is selected automatically for"
" the corresponding sampling path. [#7767](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7767)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Model Runner "
"V2的ranks内核。对于相应的采样路径，该内核会自动被选择。[#7767](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7767)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:50
msgid ""
"Reduced avoidable Triton recompilation caused by runtime function "
"parameters. The cache-friendly path is automatic; no manual setting is "
"needed. [#7481](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7481) "
"[#7483](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7483)"
msgstr ""
"减少了由运行时函数参数导致的可避免的Triton重新编译。缓存友好的路径是自动的，无需手动设置。[#7481](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7481) [#7483](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7483)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:51
msgid ""
"Reused equivalent HCCL process groups to reduce distributed initialization "
"overhead. Reuse is automatic for matching groups. "
"[#7654](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7654)"
msgstr ""
"复用等效的HCCL进程组以减少分布式初始化开销。对于匹配的组，复用是自动的。[#7654](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7654)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:52
msgid ""
"Deferred CPU binding until worker warmup completes to avoid interfering with"
" initialization. CPU binding is enabled by default on supported ARM servers;"
" no manual setting is needed unless it was explicitly disabled. "
"[#7829](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7829)"
msgstr ""
"将CPU绑定延迟到工作器预热完成之后，以避免干扰初始化。在受支持的ARM服务器上，CPU绑定默认启用；除非显式禁用，否则无需手动设置。[#7829](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7829)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:53
msgid ""
"Converted eligible Conv3D operations to linear operations when kernel size "
"equals stride. Conversion is automatic for matching models. "
"[#8318](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8318)"
msgstr ""
"当内核大小等于步长时，将符合条件的Conv3D运算转换为线性运算。对于匹配的模型，转换是自动的。[#8318](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8318)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:54
msgid ""
"Optimized MoE routing on Ascend 310P. It applies automatically to supported "
"310P MoE workloads. [#9105](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9105)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Ascend 310P上的MoE路由。该优化会自动应用于受支持的310P "
"MoE工作负载。[#9105](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9105)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:55
msgid ""
"Added NZ-format W4A8 MoE compressed tensors for supported quantized models. "
"Load a compatible W4A8 checkpoint with Ascend quantization; format selection"
" is automatic. [#9625](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9625)"
msgstr ""
"为受支持的量化模型新增了NZ格式的W4A8 "
"MoE压缩张量。使用Ascend量化加载兼容的W4A8检查点即可，格式选择是自动的。[#9625](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9625)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:56
msgid ""
"Optimized irregular-mask construction for PCP/DCP with speculative decoding."
" Enable context parallelism and speculative decoding; no separate "
"optimization switch is needed. [#9678](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9678)"
msgstr ""
"优化了PCP/DCP在投机解码下的不规则掩码构建。启用上下文并行和投机解码即可，无需单独的优化开关。[#9678](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9678)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:57
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reworked reduce sampling for DFlash and MTP. This remains experimental and "
"disabled by default; enable it with "
"`additional_config.enable_reduce_sample=true` for distributed greedy, "
"top-k/top-p, or rejection sampling. [#8308](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/8308) [#9735](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9735)"
msgstr ""
"重构了DFlash和MTP的reduce采样。该功能仍处于实验阶段，默认关闭；可通过`additional_config.enable_reduce_sample=true`启用，用于分布式贪心、top-k/top-"
"p或拒绝采样。[#8308](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/8308) "
"[#9735](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9735)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:58
msgid ""
"Added multistream compute-communication overlap for DeepSeek V4 DSA "
"compressor, indexer-select, CV-parallel, and pure-prefill paths. Enable "
"FlashComm1 and the applicable DSA-CP/overlap configuration; the optimized "
"subpaths are then selected automatically. [#9433](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9433) [#9441](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9441) [#9450](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9450) [#9504](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9504) [#9530](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9530) [#10518](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10518)"
msgstr ""
"为DeepSeek V4 DSA压缩器、indexer-select、CV并行和纯prefill路径增加了多流计算-"
"通信重叠。启用FlashComm1和适用的DSA-"
"CP/重叠配置后，优化子路径将自动被选中。[#9433](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9433) [#9441](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9441) [#9450](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9450) [#9504](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9504) [#9530](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9530) [#10518](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10518)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:59
msgid ""
"Reused DeepSeek V4 DSA `topk_indices` across decode steps through "
"IndexCache. It applies automatically to eligible DSA decode workloads. "
"[#9390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9390)"
msgstr ""
"通过IndexCache在解码步骤间复用DeepSeek V4 "
"DSA的`topk_indices`。该优化自动适用于符合条件的DSA解码工作负载。[#9390](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9390)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:60
msgid ""
"Removed a host-device synchronization point from PIECEWISE graph execution. "
"`FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` is the default graph mode, so no manual configuration "
"is needed. [#9025](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9025)"
msgstr ""
"移除了PIECEWISE图执行中的主机-"
"设备同步点。`FULL_AND_PIECEWISE`是默认图模式，因此无需手动配置。[#9025](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9025)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:61
msgid ""
"Optimized shared-expert overlap timing in FusedMoE. Enable the supported "
"shared-expert overlap configuration; timing optimization is automatic within"
" that path. [#9413](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9413)"
msgstr ""
"优化了FusedMoE中共享专家重叠的时序。启用支持的共享专家重叠配置后，该路径内的时序优化将自动生效。[#9413](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9413)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:62
msgid ""
"Skipped unnecessary slot-mapping computation for Mamba groups in hybrid-"
"cache models. It applies automatically when the model uses a Mamba cache "
"group. [#10492](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10492)"
msgstr ""
"跳过了混合缓存模型中Mamba组不必要的槽位映射计算。当模型使用Mamba缓存组时，该优化自动生效。[#10492](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10492)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:63
msgid ""
"Built single-rank DSA compressor metadata on device to remove CPU "
"construction and synchronization. It applies automatically to eligible non-"
"CP DSA compressed-KV paths. [#10741](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10741)"
msgstr ""
"在设备上构建单秩DSA压缩器元数据，以消除CPU构建和同步。该优化自动适用于符合条件的非CP "
"DSA压缩KV路径。[#10741](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10741)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:64
msgid ""
"Vectorized SFA local-sequence-length computation to remove per-request NPU-"
"to-CPU synchronization. It applies automatically to SFA workloads. "
"[#11816](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11816)"
msgstr ""
"向量化了SFA局部序列长度计算，以消除每个请求的NPU到CPU同步。该优化自动适用于SFA工作负载。[#11816](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11816)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:65
msgid ""
"Replaced the SFA DSA-CP output merge's full all-gather with token-sharded "
"all-to-all to reduce communication and peak receive-buffer use. Enable "
"FlashComm1 and `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp=true`; no separate "
"optimization switch is needed. [#12137](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12137)"
msgstr ""
"将SFA DSA-CP输出合并中的全量all-gather替换为token分片的all-to-"
"all，以减少通信量和接收缓冲区峰值使用。启用FlashComm1和`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp=true`即可，无需单独的优化开关。[#12137](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12137)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:66
msgid ""
"Reduced restore and output-merge overhead in the PCP FlashAttention path. "
"Enable PCP with `--prefill-context-parallel-size`; the optimized restore "
"path is automatic. [#11842](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11842)"
msgstr ""
"降低了PCP FlashAttention路径中的恢复和输出合并开销。通过`--prefill-context-parallel-"
"size`启用PCP后，优化后的恢复路径将自动生效。[#11842](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11842)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:67
msgid ""
"Avoided host-to-device synchronization while building context-parallel "
"speculative-proposer metadata. Enable context parallelism and speculative "
"decoding; the optimized metadata path is automatic. "
"[#11862](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11862)"
msgstr ""
"在构建上下文并行投机提议者元数据时避免了主机到设备的同步。启用上下文并行和投机解码后，优化后的元数据路径将自动生效。[#11862](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11862)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:68
msgid ""
"Snapshotted query start locations before asynchronous host-to-device copies "
"to preserve non-blocking metadata transfers. It applies automatically to "
"asynchronous copy paths. [#12071](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/12071)"
msgstr ""
"在异步主机到设备拷贝前对查询起始位置进行快照，以保持非阻塞元数据传输。该优化自动适用于异步拷贝路径。[#12071](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12071)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:69
msgid ""
"Added fused W4A8 MoE dispatch, FFN, and combine to overlap communication "
"with computation. Load a supported W4A8 MoE checkpoint with Ascend "
"quantization; fused-kernel selection is automatic. "
"[#7779](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7779)"
msgstr ""
"增加了融合的W4A8 MoE分发、FFN和合并，以实现通信与计算的重叠。使用Ascend量化加载支持的W4A8 "
"MoE检查点后，融合内核的选择将自动完成。[#7779](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7779)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:70
msgid ""
"Added asynchronous all-gather for DSA-CP output-projection TP weights. "
"Enable FlashComm1 and `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp=true`; the "
"asynchronous path is automatic. [#10694](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10694)"
msgstr ""
"为DSA-CP输出投影TP权重增加了异步all-"
"gather。启用FlashComm1和`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp=true`后，异步路径将自动生效。[#10694](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10694)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:71
msgid ""
"Improved DeepSeek V4 prefix-cache hit rates when MTP is enabled. Prefix "
"caching is enabled by default in vLLM V1; no flag is needed unless it was "
"previously disabled. [#11107](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11107)"
msgstr ""
"改进了启用MTP时DeepSeek V4的prefix缓存命中率。vLLM "
"V1中prefix缓存默认启用；除非之前已禁用，否则无需额外标志。[#11107](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11107)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:72
msgid ""
"Reused prebuilt chunk host metadata to reduce synchronization overhead for "
"Qwen3.5 and MiniMax-M2.5 workloads. It applies automatically to the affected"
" model paths. [#9310](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9310)"
msgstr ""
"复用了预构建的chunk主机元数据，以减少Qwen3.5和MiniMax-M2.5工作负载的同步开销。该优化自动适用于受影响的模型路径。[#9310](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9310)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:73
msgid ""
"Parallelized Mooncake KV receive handling for P/D-disaggregated deployments."
" Configure the Mooncake KV-transfer connector; receive parallelism is "
"automatic. [#10548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10548)"
msgstr ""
"为P/D分离部署并行化了Mooncake KV接收处理。配置Mooncake "
"KV传输连接器后，接收并行将自动生效。[#10548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10548)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:74
msgid ""
"Optimized AscendStore key construction and KV Pool miss handling to reduce "
"host overhead. Configure `AscendStoreConnector`; the optimized paths are "
"selected automatically. [#12783](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/12783)†"
msgstr ""
"优化了AscendStore键构建和KV池未命中处理，以降低主机开销。配置`AscendStoreConnector`后，优化路径将自动被选中。[#12783](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12783)†"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:75
msgid ""
"Reused grouped block hashes across AscendStore query, save, and load "
"operations to reduce repeated host-side hashing. Configure "
"`AscendStoreConnector`; reuse is automatic. "
"[#13169](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/13169)†"
msgstr ""
"在AscendStore的查询、保存和加载操作间复用分组块哈希，以减少重复的主机端哈希计算。配置`AscendStoreConnector`后，复用将自动生效。[#13169](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/13169)†"

