"Fixed AscendStore compatibility with pipeline parallelism and surfaced "
"backend failures. [#12762](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/12762)†"
msgstr ""
"修复了 AscendStore 与流水线并行的兼容性，并暴露了后端失败。[#12762](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12762)†"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:89
