"修复了逐层 KV Pool 传输中无效 GVA 的处理。[#12643](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/12643)†"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:90
msgid ""
"Fixed A5 BF16 `mm_reduce_scatter` communication-mode selection and "
"restricted FP8 quantization detection to A5 devices. "
"[#12826](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12826)† "
"[#12895](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12895)†"
