"CP的部署必须显式启用这两个选项。[#9668](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9668) [#9697](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9697) [#9910](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
