#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:136
msgid ""
"Pipeline parallelism (PP) combined with prefill context parallelism (PCP) is"
" not supported in v0.23.0."
msgstr "v0.23.0不支持流水线并行（PP）与预填充上下文并行（PCP）的组合使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:137
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On Atlas 300I DUO or Atlas 200I Pro (310P), Qwen3.5-2B-W8A8 GSM8K accuracy "
"can fluctuate by more than 1% compared with the floating-point model. "
"[#14335](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/14335)"
msgstr ""
"在Atlas 300I DUO或Atlas 200I Pro（310P）上，与浮点模型相比，Qwen3.5-2B-W8A8 "
"GSM8K的准确率波动可能超过1%。[#14335](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14335)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:138
msgid ""
"DeepSeek V4 on A2 or A3 can experience 1-2 second TPOT spikes under high "
"concurrency when varying input shapes trigger Triton kernel recompilation. "
"[#14324](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/14324)"
msgstr ""
"在A2或A3上运行DeepSeek "
"V4时，当不同的输入形状触发Triton内核重新编译时，高并发下可能会出现1-2秒的TPOT峰值。[#14324](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/14324)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:139
msgid ""
"DeepSeek V4 Flash and GLM-5.1 SWE benchmark results can vary because of "
"intermittent evaluation failures, including container crashes, timeouts, "
"dependency-download failures, and agent nondeterminism. "
"[#14326](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/14326)"
msgstr ""
"由于间歇性评估失败（包括容器崩溃、超时、依赖项下载失败和代理非确定性），DeepSeek V4 Flash和GLM-5.1 "
"SWE基准测试结果可能会有所不同。[#14326](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14326)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:140
#, python-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V3.1 large-EP deployments have a reported 3%-5% performance gap "
"from the target performance. [#14327](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14327)"
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek-V3.1大型EP部署与目标性能之间存在3%-5%的性能差距。[#14327](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/14327)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:141
msgid ""
"GLM-5.1 on an Ascend 950 single-node mixed P/D deployment can incur "
"excessive P/D transfer overhead for a 64K-input/1K-output workload without a"
" prefix-cache hit. [#14328](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14328)"
msgstr ""
"在Ascend "
"950单节点混合P/D部署上运行GLM-5.1时，对于没有前缀缓存命中的64K输入/1K输出工作负载，可能会产生过多的P/D传输开销。[#14328](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/14328)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:142
msgid ""
"GLM-5.1 P/D-disaggregated serving with both `sfa_c8` and `li_c8` enabled has"
" a reported performance regression for 64K-input/1K-output workloads. "
"[#14329](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/14329)"
msgstr ""
"同时启用`sfa_c8`和`li_c8`的GLM-5.1 "
"P/D分离式服务在64K输入/1K输出工作负载下存在性能回退问题。[#14329](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/14329)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:143
msgid ""
"In graph mode, `torch.ops._C_ascend.mla_preprocess` and "
"`torch.ops._C_ascend.batch_matmul_transpose` can emit an `rtMemcpy` 107030 "
"error in plog; the reported error does not affect inference. "
"[#14347](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/14347)"
msgstr ""
"在图模式下，`torch.ops._C_ascend.mla_preprocess`和`torch.ops._C_ascend.batch_matmul_transpose`可能会在plog中产生`rtMemcpy`"
" 107030错误；该错误不影响推理。[#14347](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14347)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:144
msgid ""
"GLM-5.2-W4A8C8 P/D-disaggregated serving with `enable_sparse_sfa_c8` can "
"show GPQA accuracy fluctuations of approximately 2-3 percentage points "
"across repeated runs. [#14378](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/14378)"
msgstr ""
"启用`enable_sparse_sfa_c8`的GLM-5.2-W4A8C8 "
"P/D分离式服务在重复运行中，GPQA准确率可能会出现约2-3个百分点的波动。[#14378](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/14378)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:145
#, python-format
msgid ""
"DeepSeek-V3.1 2P1D throughput has a reported regression of about 15% "
"compared with v0.18.0 in high-throughput deployments. "
"[#12349](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12349)"
msgstr ""
"在高吞吐量部署中，与v0.18.0相比，DeepSeek-V3.1 "
"2P1D的吞吐量存在约15%的回退。[#12349](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/12349)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:146
msgid ""
"DeepSeek V4 Pro has an open long-running stability report involving "
"increasing memory use. [#12345](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/12345)"
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek V4 "
"Pro有一个未关闭的长期稳定性报告，涉及内存使用量不断增加的问题。[#12345](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/12345)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:147
msgid ""
"Qwen3-30B-A3B floating-point serving has a reported single-batch performance"
" regression. [#12337](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/12337)"
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-30B-A3B浮点服务存在单批次性能回退问题。[#12337](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/12337)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:148
msgid ""
"AscendStore KV Pool has backend-specific constraints for layerwise Memcache,"
" SSD offload, hybrid-attention load failures, and graph fallback behavior. "
"[#12390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12390)"
msgstr ""
"AscendStore "
"KV池在逐层Memcache、SSD卸载、混合注意力加载失败和图回退行为方面存在特定于后端的约束。[#12390](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/12390)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:149
msgid ""
"Ascend 950 graph capture is temporarily limited to a reduced set of stages "
"because of HDK incompatibility, which avoids crashes but can reduce "
"performance. [#12998](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/12998)"
msgstr ""
"由于HDK不兼容，Ascend "
"950图捕获暂时仅限于减少的阶段集，这可以避免崩溃，但可能会降低性能。[#12998](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/12998)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:151
msgid "v0.23.0rc1 - 2026.07.20"
msgstr "v0.23.0rc1 - 2026.07.20"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:153
msgid ""
"We're excited to announce v0.23.0rc1, the first release candidate for the "
"vLLM Ascend v0.23.0 release line. This release aligns the plugin with "
"upstream vLLM v0.23.0 and expands model, context-parallel, KV-cache offload,"
" and Ascend 950 support. Please follow the [official "
"documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.23.0rc1/) to get "
"started."
msgstr ""
"我们很高兴地宣布 v0.23.0rc1 发布，这是 vLLM Ascend v0.23.0 系列的第一个候选版本。此版本使插件与上游 vLLM "
"v0.23.0 保持一致，并扩展了模型、上下文并行、KV-cache 卸载和 Ascend 950 "
"的支持。请按照[官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.23.0rc1/)开始使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:157
msgid ""
"**Expanded model support**: Added GLM-5.2 support on A2 and A3, and Ascend "
"310P support for Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, Qwen3.5, and Qwen3.6. "
"[#10441](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10441) "
"[#11264](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11264) "
"[#10257](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10257) "
"[#12115](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12115)"
msgstr ""
"**扩展模型支持**：在 A2 和 A3 上新增 GLM-5.2 支持，并在 Ascend 310P 上新增对 "
"Qwen3-ASR-1.7B、Qwen3.5 和 Qwen3.6 的支持。[#10441](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10441) [#11264](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11264) [#10257](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10257) [#12115](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12115)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:158
msgid ""
"**Sparse attention and context parallelism**: Added SFA DCP with a "
"replicated indexer, compact KV gather, and C8 support. "
"[#11819](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11819) "
"[#11981](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11981) "
"[#11846](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11846) "
"[#11871](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11871)"
msgstr ""
"**稀疏注意力与上下文并行**：新增 SFA DCP，支持复制索引器、紧凑 KV 收集和 "
"C8。[#11819](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11819) "
"[#11981](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11981) "
"[#11846](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11846) "
"[#11871](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11871)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:159
msgid ""
"**KV-cache lifecycle and offload**: Added recompute KV-cache offload for P/D"
" decoder nodes, AscendStore coordination, and layerwise KV Pooling with a "
"Memcache backend. [#10742](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10742) [#10393](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10393) [#11585](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11585)"
msgstr ""
"**KV-cache 生命周期与卸载**：新增针对 P/D 解码器节点的重计算 KV-cache 卸载、AscendStore 协调，以及基于 "
"Memcache 后端的逐层 KV 池化。[#10742](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10742) [#10393](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10393) [#11585](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11585)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:160
msgid ""
"**Ascend 950 quantization and communication**: Added W4A16 MXFP4, all-gather"
" EP MXFP4, and low-accuracy token-dispatch paths. "
"[#11014](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11014) "
"[#11287](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11287) "
"[#11718](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11718) "
"[#11766](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11766)"
msgstr ""
"**Ascend 950 量化与通信**：新增 W4A16 MXFP4、all-gather EP MXFP4 以及低精度 token "
"分发路径。[#11014](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11014) "
"[#11287](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11287) "
"[#11718](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11718) "
"[#11766](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11766)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:164
msgid ""
"Added DeepSeek V4 MTP graph support. [#11062](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11062)"
msgstr ""
"新增 DeepSeek V4 MTP 图支持。[#11062](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11062)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:165
msgid ""
"Added Virtual Width Network Eagle3 and Eagle3 support with chunked pipeline "
"parallelism. [#10042](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10042) [#10566](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10566)"
msgstr ""
"新增 Virtual Width Network Eagle3 和 Eagle3 "
"支持，并支持分块流水线并行。[#10042](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10042) [#10566](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/10566)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:167
msgid "Experimental Features or Optimizations"
msgstr "实验性功能或优化"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:169
msgid ""
"Added experimental Step3P7 and Step3P5 support, including Step3P5 MTP. "
"[#10697](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10697)"
msgstr ""
"新增实验性 Step3P7 和 Step3P5 支持，包括 Step3P5 MTP。[#10697](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10697)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:170
msgid ""
"Added experimental Gemma4 support on A2 and Ascend 950. "
"[#11091](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11091) "
"[#10643](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10643)"
msgstr ""
"在 A2 和 Ascend 950 上新增实验性 Gemma4 支持。[#11091](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11091) [#10643](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10643)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:171
msgid ""
"Improved the DeepSeek V4 prefix-cache hit rate. "
"[#11107](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11107)"
msgstr ""
"提升了 DeepSeek V4 前缀缓存命中率。[#11107](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11107)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:175
msgid ""
"Optimized SFA DSA-CP output merge with All-to-All communication and PCP "
"FlashAttention restore/output merge. [#12137](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/12137) [#11842](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/11842)"
msgstr ""
"优化了 SFA DSA-CP 输出合并，采用 All-to-All 通信和 PCP FlashAttention "
"恢复/输出合并。[#12137](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12137) "
"[#11842](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11842)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:176
msgid ""
"Avoided H2D synchronization in context-parallel speculative decoding "
"metadata and snapshotted query locations before asynchronous H2D copies. "
"[#11862](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11862) "
"[#12071](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12071)"
msgstr ""
"避免了上下文并行推测解码元数据中的 H2D 同步，并在异步 H2D "
"复制前快照查询位置。[#11862](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11862) "
"[#12071](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12071)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:177
msgid ""
"Parallelized KV-cache receive with a thread pool and enabled asynchronous "
"all-gather for DSA-CP output-projection TP weights. "
"[#10548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10548) "
"[#10694](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10694)"
msgstr ""
"使用线程池并行化 KV-cache 接收，并为 DSA-CP 输出投影 TP 权重启用异步 all-"
"gather。[#10548](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10548) "
"[#10694](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10694)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:178
msgid ""
"Vectorized local sequence-length computation in SFA metadata. "
"[#11816](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11816)"
msgstr ""
"在 SFA 元数据中向量化本地序列长度计算。[#11816](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11816)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:182
msgid ""
"Fixed GLM-5.1 IndexCache weight loading and a GLM-4.7-Flash `IndexError` on "
"the first request with MTP and layerwise MemCache. "
"[#11363](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11363) "
"[#11829](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11829)"
msgstr ""
"修复了 GLM-5.1 IndexCache 权重加载问题，以及使用 MTP 和逐层 MemCache 时首次请求出现的 GLM-4.7-Flash "
"`IndexError`。[#11363](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11363) [#11829](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/11829)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:183
msgid ""
"Fixed Qwen3.5 GDN accuracy regressions across PCP, MTP, and DCP graph "
"replay, including a mixed-length PCP out-of-bounds crash, while restoring "
"the previous model-runner dispatch behavior. "
"[#11195](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11195) "
"[#11893](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/11893) "
"[#12027](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12027) "
"[#12283](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/12283)"
msgstr ""
