"project/vllm-ascend/issues/12338)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:232
msgid ""
"On Ascend 950, Qwen3.5-397B-W8A8-MXFP8-FULL_QUANT in a P/D-disaggregated "
"deployment without MTP can alternate between correct and incorrect outputs. "
"[#12339](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12339)"
