"project/vllm-ascend/issues/12349)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:235
msgid ""
"KV-cache transfer can produce precision issues and TP-shard inconsistencies "
"when reformatting occurs before all pull tasks for a request have completed."
