"修复）和 MTP。[#9757](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9757) "
"[#9473](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9473) "
"[#9935](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9935)"

