"uses CANN 9.1.0 beta**. **Note**: `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` requires HDK 25.5.1+ "
"/ CANN 8.5.0+ for the stream-budget fix; older stacks are still limited by "
"the legacy stream budget and may fall back to `PIECEWISE`."
msgstr ""
"**CANN**：A2/A3/Ascend 950使用9.0.0（与v0.20.2rc1相同）；**310P使用CANN 9.1.0 "
"beta**。**注意**：`FULL_AND_PIECEWISE`需要HDK 25.5.1+ / CANN "
"8.5.0+以修复流预算问题；旧版本仍受旧版流预算限制，可能回退至`PIECEWISE`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:394
msgid "**PyTorch / torch_npu**: 2.10.0 (unchanged from v0.20.2rc1)."
msgstr "**PyTorch / torch_npu**：2.10.0（与v0.20.2rc1相同）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:395
msgid "**triton-ascend**: 3.2.1 (unchanged from v0.20.2rc1)."
msgstr "**triton-ascend**：3.2.1（与v0.20.2rc1相同）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:396
msgid ""
"**Mooncake**: Upgraded from v0.3.8.post1 to v0.3.9. "
"[#10339](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/10339)"
msgstr ""
"**Mooncake**：从v0.3.8.post1升级至v0.3.9。[#10339](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/10339)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:398
#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:466
msgid "Breaking Changes and Migration Notes"
msgstr "重大变更与迁移说明"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:400
msgid ""
"**`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_CONTEXT_PARALLEL` Removed**: The environment variable "
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_CONTEXT_PARALLEL` has been removed as part of the "
"migration to `AscendConfig`. Users should migrate any remaining uses to the "
"equivalent AscendConfig option. [#9668](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9668)"
msgstr ""
"**`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_CONTEXT_PARALLEL`已移除**：环境变量`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_CONTEXT_PARALLEL`已随迁移至`AscendConfig`而移除。用户应将所有剩余使用迁移至等效的AscendConfig选项。[#9668](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9668)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:401
msgid ""
"**DSA-CP Configuration Decoupling**: DSA-CP is now controlled via "
"`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`, decoupled from the FlashComm1 switch. "
"Users who previously relied on FC1 implicitly enabling DSA-CP must now "
"explicitly set both `enable_flashcomm1` and `enable_dsa_cp`. "
"[#9697](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9697) "
"[#9910](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9910)"
msgstr ""
"**DSA-CP配置解耦**：DSA-"
"CP现通过`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`控制，与FlashComm1开关解耦。之前依赖FC1隐式启用DSA-"
"CP的用户，现在必须显式设置`enable_flashcomm1`和`enable_dsa_cp`。[#9697](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9697) [#9910](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9910)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:402
msgid ""
"**Python 3.12 in Docker Images**: All Docker base images now use Python 3.12"
" (`py3.12`). If your deployment or custom images depend on `py3.11`, update "
"your image tags accordingly. [#9558](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9558)"
msgstr ""
"**Docker 镜像中的 Python 3.12**：所有 Docker 基础镜像现已使用 Python "
"3.12（`py3.12`）。如果您的部署或自定义镜像依赖于 "
"`py3.11`，请相应更新镜像标签。[#9558](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9558)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:406
msgid ""
"Refreshed and optimized documentation for the current development branch. "
"[#9606](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9606)"
msgstr ""
"刷新并优化了当前开发分支的文档。[#9606](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9606)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:407
msgid ""
"Updated model-code converter writing guide. [#9881](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9881)"
msgstr ""
"更新了模型代码转换器编写指南。[#9881](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9881)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:408
msgid ""
"Added DSA-CP configuration documentation for DeepSeek V3.2 and GLM5. "
"[#9910](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9910)"
msgstr ""
"新增了 DeepSeek V3.2 和 GLM5 的 DSA-CP 配置文档。[#9910](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9910)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:409
msgid ""
"Added Ascend 950 disaggregated PD endpoint configuration documentation. "
"[#9690](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9690)"
msgstr ""
"新增了 Ascend 950 解耦式 PD 端点配置文档。[#9690](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9690)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:413
msgid ""
"**FULL_AND_PIECEWISE on older HDK/CANN**: HDK < 25.5.1 / CANN < 8.5.0 stacks"
" still have the old stream-budget limitation, which may cause graph capture "
"failures or fallback to `PIECEWISE` mode. Upgrade to HDK 25.5.1+ / CANN "
"8.5.0+ is recommended for full `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` support."
msgstr ""
"**旧版 HDK/CANN 上的 FULL_AND_PIECEWISE**：HDK < 25.5.1 / CANN < 8.5.0 "
"栈仍存在旧的流预算限制，可能导致图捕获失败或回退到 `PIECEWISE` 模式。建议升级至 HDK 25.5.1+ / CANN 8.5.0+ "
"以获得完整的 `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` 支持。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:414
msgid ""
"GLM5/GLM5.1 W4A8 deployments have known issues in some advanced "
"configurations. CANN 9.0 with MC2 can return inaccurate output, FlashComm "
"can fail during model startup, and MTP weight loading can fail in 1P1D A3 "
"deployments. [#9395](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9395) [#9658](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9658) [#9655](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9655)"
msgstr ""
"GLM5/GLM5.1 W4A8 部署在某些高级配置中存在已知问题。CANN 9.0 搭配 MC2 可能返回不准确的输出，FlashComm "
"可能在模型启动时失败，MTP 权重加载在 1P1D A3 部署中可能失败。[#9395](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9395) [#9658](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9658) [#9655](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9655)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:415
msgid ""
"GLM-5.1 deployments can hit `MoeDistributeDispatchV2`/NPU graph failures "
"when Expert Parallel is used together with FULL graph mode. The reported "
"workaround is to disable Expert Parallel for FULL graph mode, or use "
"PIECEWISE/eager mode. [#9503](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9503)"
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.1 部署在同时使用专家并行和 FULL 图模式时，可能遇到 `MoeDistributeDispatchV2`/NPU "
"图失败。已报告的解决方法是针对 FULL 图模式禁用专家并行，或使用 PIECEWISE/eager "
"模式。[#9503](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9503)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:416
#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:479
msgid ""
"Qwen3.6-35B-A3B may shut down when MTP/speculative decoding is enabled, with"
" `numAcceptedTokens[0]=4 exceeds varlen segment length=3` reported during "
"shape/dtype processing. [#9956](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9956)"
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.6-35B-A3B 在启用 MTP/推测解码时可能关闭，在形状/数据类型处理期间报告 `numAcceptedTokens[0]=4 "
"exceeds varlen segment length=3`。[#9956](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9956)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:417
#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:480
msgid ""
"GLM-5.1 can hang on the P node in 200K long-sequence 1P1D agent workloads "
"after long-running service, with "
"`MoeDistributeDispatchV2`/`aclnnMoeDistributeDispatchV4` reporting an AICore"
" timeout. [#9958](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9958)"
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.1 在长时间运行服务后，可能在 200K 长序列 1P1D agent 工作负载的 P "
"节点上挂起，`MoeDistributeDispatchV2`/`aclnnMoeDistributeDispatchV4` 报告 AICore "
"超时。[#9958](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9958)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:418
#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:481
msgid ""
"GLM5 W4A8 deployments can see a significantly lower speculative decoding "
"acceptance rate when MTP3 is used together with FlashComm. "
"[#9803](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9803)"
msgstr ""
"GLM5 W4A8 部署在同时使用 MTP3 和 FlashComm "
"时，推测解码接受率可能显著降低。[#9803](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/9803)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:419
msgid ""
"**DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool**: When enabling KV Pool for DeepSeek-V4, the `--no-"
"disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` flag must be added, otherwise the service "
"will OOM at startup. Additionally, KV Pool for DSv4 stores all states for "
"all compression ratio families — storing a sequence of 1M tokens takes "
"approximately 300GB, which is the same behavior as upstream vLLM. "
"[#9975](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975)"
msgstr ""
"**DeepSeek-V4 KV池**：为DeepSeek-V4启用KV池时，必须添加`--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-"
"manager`标志，否则服务启动时会因内存不足（OOM）而失败。此外，DSv4的KV池会存储所有压缩比族的所有状态——存储100万个token的序列大约需要300GB，这与上游vLLM的行为一致。[#9975](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:421
msgid "v0.20.2rc1 - 2026.06.03"
msgstr "v0.20.2rc1 - 2026.06.03"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:423
msgid ""
"We're excited to announce the release of v0.20.2rc1 for vLLM Ascend. This is"
" the first release candidate for the v0.20.2 release line. Please follow the"
" [official doc](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest) to get "
"started."
msgstr ""
"我们很高兴地宣布vLLM "
"Ascend的v0.20.2rc1版本发布。这是v0.20.2发布系列的第一个候选版本。请按照[官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest)开始使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:427
msgid ""
"**DeepSeek V4 Support**: Added end-to-end support for DeepSeek V4, including"
" the model architecture, DSA attention backend, KV cache management, "
"distributed inference, tool-call parser, MTP support, KV Pool adaptation, "
"and custom operator enablement. [#9270](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9270) [#9385](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9385) [#9228](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9228)"
msgstr ""
"**DeepSeek V4支持**：新增对DeepSeek "
"V4的端到端支持，包括模型架构、DSA注意力后端、KV缓存管理、分布式推理、工具调用解析器、MTP支持、KV池适配以及自定义算子启用。[#9270](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9270) [#9385](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9385) [#9228](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9228)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:428
msgid ""
"**Ascend 950 Products and XLite Quantization Expansion**: Added MXFP4 "
"flatquant with row parallelism for Ascend 950 Products and expanded XLite "
"support to GLM-4.7 W8A8 quantization. [#9391](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9391) [#9415](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9415)"
msgstr ""
"**Ascend 950产品和XLite量化扩展**：为Ascend 950产品新增了带行并行的MXFP4 "
"flatquant，并将XLite支持扩展到GLM-4.7的W8A8量化。[#9391](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9391) [#9415](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9415)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:432
msgid ""
"Added Flash Attention 3 support for training-inference consistency. The "
"backend is ready in vLLM Ascend and will become directly usable once the FA3"
" package is publicly available. [#9060](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9060)"
msgstr ""
"新增Flash Attention 3支持，用于训练-推理一致性。该后端已在vLLM "
"Ascend中准备就绪，待FA3包公开发布后即可直接使用。[#9060](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9060)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:433
msgid ""
"Added DeepSeek PCP/DCP adaptation to improve support for disaggregated "
"deployments. [#9058](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9058)"
msgstr ""
"新增DeepSeek PCP/DCP适配，以改进对分离式部署的支持。[#9058](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9058)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:434
msgid ""
"Added a dedicated `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp` switch to decouple DSA-"
"CP from FC1. DSA-CP now requires both FC1 and DSA-CP to be explicitly "
"enabled, allowing FC1 to stay enabled while DSA-CP is disabled when needed. "
"[#9878](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9878)"
msgstr ""
"新增专用开关`additional_config.enable_dsa_cp`，将DSA-CP与FC1解耦。现在启用DSA-"
"CP需要同时显式启用FC1和DSA-CP，从而允许在需要时保持FC1启用而禁用DSA-"
"CP。[#9878](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9878)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:435
msgid ""
"Added merged graph support for DFlash workloads. "
"[#9074](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9074)"
msgstr ""
"为DFlash工作负载新增合并图支持。[#9074](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9074)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:436
msgid ""
"Added LoRA support for Qwen3.5 dense models. "
"[#9023](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9023)"
msgstr ""
"为Qwen3.5密集模型新增LoRA支持。[#9023](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9023)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:437
msgid ""
"Added KV pool adaptation for DeepSeek V4 and separated MTP-layer KV cache "
"sharding for DeepSeek V4 speculative decoding. "
"[#9385](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9385) "
"[#9367](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9367)"
msgstr ""
"新增DeepSeek V4的KV池适配，并为DeepSeek "
"V4推测解码分离了MTP层KV缓存分片。[#9385](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9385) [#9367](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9367)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:441
msgid ""
"Added DeepSeek V4 custom operators required for the new model path, "
"registered the operators for Ascend 910B, and switched the DeepSeek V4 "
"`hc_pre` path to a fused operator. [#9228](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9228) [#9339](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9339) [#9396](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9396)"
msgstr ""
"新增了新模型路径所需的DeepSeek V4自定义算子，在Ascend 910B上注册了这些算子，并将DeepSeek "
"V4的`hc_pre`路径切换为融合算子。[#9228](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9228) [#9339](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9339) [#9396](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9396)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:442
msgid ""
"Enabled MXFP4 flatquant and row parallel support on Ascend 950 Products. "
"[#9391](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9391)"
msgstr ""
"在Ascend 950系列产品上启用了MXFP4 flatquant和行并行支持。[#9391](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9391)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:443
msgid ""
"Enabled MC2 dispatch and combine support for MXFP4/MXFP8 quantization on "
"Ascend 950 Products. [#9365](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9365) [#9328](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9328)"
msgstr ""
"在Ascend 950系列产品上启用了MXFP4/MXFP8量化的MC2分发与合并支持。[#9365](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9365) [#9328](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9328)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:444
msgid ""
"Improved 310P support by optimizing fused operators for Qwen3.5 Dense "
"ACLGraph and simplifying the 310P RMSNormGated path. "
"[#9104](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9104) "
"[#9489](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9489)"
msgstr ""
"通过优化Qwen3.5 Dense ACLGraph的融合算子并简化310P "
"RMSNormGated路径，改进了310P支持。[#9104](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9104) [#9489](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9489)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:448
msgid ""
"Added DeepSeek V4 DSA multistream overlap optimizations across compressor, "
"indexer-select, CV parallel, and pure-prefill compute-communication overlap "
"paths. [#9450](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9450) "
"[#9441](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9441) "
"[#9433](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9433) "
"[#9504](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9504)"
msgstr ""
"新增了DeepSeek V4 "
"DSA多流重叠优化，涵盖压缩器、索引器选择、CV并行以及纯预填充计算通信重叠路径。[#9450](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9450) [#9441](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9441) [#9433](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9433) [#9504](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9504)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:449
msgid ""
"Reused DSA `topk_indices` across decode steps with IndexCache to reduce "
"repeated DeepSeek V4 index computation. [#9390](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9390)"
msgstr ""
"通过IndexCache在解码步骤间复用DSA `topk_indices`，以减少重复的DeepSeek "
"V4索引计算。[#9390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9390)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:450
msgid ""
"Fixed the missing enablement for `cv_indexer_qkv_prepare` multistream "
"parallelism in the new overlap path. [#9530](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9530)"
msgstr ""
"修复了新重叠路径中`cv_indexer_qkv_prepare`多流并行未启用的问题。[#9530](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9530)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:451
msgid ""
"Reduced host-device synchronization overhead by removing the sync point in "
"PIECEWISE mode. [#9025](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9025)"
msgstr ""
"通过移除PIECEWISE模式中的同步点，降低了主机与设备间的同步开销。[#9025](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9025)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:452
msgid ""
"Optimized shared expert overlap timing in FusedMoE. "
"[#9413](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9413)"
msgstr ""
"优化了FusedMoE中共享专家的重叠时序。[#9413](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/9413)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:453
msgid ""
"[Experimental] Added reduce sampling with `enable_reduce_sample` to lower "
"Tensor Parallel communication overhead in distributed greedy, top-k/top-p, "
"and rejection sampling paths. [#8308](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/8308)"
msgstr ""
"[实验性] 新增了带`enable_reduce_sample`的reduce采样功能，以降低分布式贪婪采样、top-k/top-"
