"[#6696](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/6696)"
msgstr ""
"**RL（强化学习）**：[实验性]通过AscendC和triton算子实现了批量不变性特性，增强了RL功能，并新增了路由重放特性。[#6590](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/6590) [#6696](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/6696)"

