msgid "Known Issue"
msgstr "已知问题"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:596
msgid ""
"Currently, `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2` is not recommended for multi-DP "
"and large number of tokens case(`kv_producer` or `kv_both`), this case may "
"create large number of padded tokens across dp, which will be routed to "
"certain experts, and make certain ranks receive tokens overload, resulting "
"accuracy and performance issues. [#8320](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8320)"
msgstr ""
"目前，不建议在多DP和大量令牌场景（`kv_producer`或`kv_both`）中使用`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2`，此场景可能会跨DP产生大量填充令牌，这些令牌将被路由到某些专家，导致某些rank接收令牌过载，从而引发精度和性能问题。[#8320](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8320)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:597
msgid ""
"Currently, EPLB cannot support `minimax_m2` model and W4A8 quantization. "
"[#8341](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8341)"
msgstr ""
"目前，EPLB不支持`minimax_m2`模型和W4A8量化。[#8341](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8341)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:598
msgid ""
"PCP and eagle3 overlaying may generate error when a prefill req's scheduled "
"token number is smaller than `1 + num_speculative_tokens`, which will make "
"this prefill req be treated as a decode req, resulting in an error. "
"[#8402](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8402)"
msgstr ""
"当预填充请求的调度令牌数小于`1 + "
"num_speculative_tokens`时，PCP和eagle3重叠可能会产生错误，这将导致该预填充请求被当作解码请求处理，从而引发错误。[#8402](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8402)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:599
msgid ""
"NPU soft partitioning + `CUDAGraphMode.PIECEWISE` is not supported. "
"[#8585](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8585)"
msgstr ""
"不支持NPU软分区 + `CUDAGraphMode.PIECEWISE`。[#8585](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8585)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:600
msgid ""
"Qwen3.x now has accuracy issue with PD disaggregation case. "
"[#8421](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8421)"
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.x在PD分离场景下存在精度问题。[#8421](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/8421)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:601
msgid ""
"Currently, there is a known issue on x86 arch, and this issue has been "
"resolved with CANN 9.0.0, if you want to deploy vllm-ascend on x86, please "
"upgrade CANN version manually. [#7993](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/7993)"
msgstr ""
"目前，x86架构上存在一个已知问题，该问题已在CANN 9.0.0中解决，如果您想在x86上部署vllm-"
"ascend，请手动升级CANN版本。[#7993](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/7993)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:602
msgid ""
"P/D proxy may leak resources on recomputed retry and mask metaserver errors "
"after. [#8852](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8852)"
msgstr ""
"P/D代理在重计算重试后可能会泄漏资源并掩盖metaserver错误。[#8852](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/8852)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:603
msgid ""
"When deploying GLM5 and Deepseek V3.2 separately via PD architecture, there "
"is a probabilistic issue of empty output or garbled characters. "
"[#8853](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8853)"
msgstr ""
"当通过PD架构分别部署GLM5和Deepseek "
"V3.2时，存在概率性输出为空或乱码的问题。[#8853](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/8853)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:604
msgid ""
"For GLM 5/5.1 under PD separation which D node setup with TP16 DP2 "
"parallelism, the GPQA accuracy fell short of the standard. "
"[#8844](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/8844)"
msgstr ""
"对于PD分离下D节点配置为TP16 DP2并行的GLM "
"5/5.1，GPQA准确率未达标。[#8844](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/8844)"

