#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:608
msgid ""
"This is the first release candidate of v0.19.1 for vLLM Ascend, based on "
"vLLM v0.19.1. This release includes significant performance optimizations, "
"new model support, hardware expansion, and important bug fixes."
msgstr ""
"这是基于vLLM v0.19.1的vLLM Ascend v0.19.1首个候选版本。此版本包含显著的性能优化、新模型支持、硬件扩展以及重要错误修复。"

