" get started."
msgstr ""
"这是vLLM Ascend "
"v0.18.0的第一个候选发布版本。请按照[官方文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest)开始使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:814
msgid ""
"C8(INT8 KV cache) is now supported for GQA attention models, and also "
"supported on DeepSeek-V3.1 with PD disaggregation scenario. "
"[#7474](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7474), "
"[#7222](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7222)"
msgstr ""
"C8（INT8 "
"KV缓存）现已支持GQA注意力模型，并在PD分离场景下支持DeepSeek-V3.1。[#7474](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7474), [#7222](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7222)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:815
msgid ""
"DeepSeek models are now supported on Ascend 950 Products through new MLA "
"operators. [#7232](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7232)"
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek模型现通过新的MLA算子支持Ascend 950产品。[#7232](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7232)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:820
msgid ""
"Support separate attention backends for target and draft models in "
"speculative decoding, allowing finer backend tuning per model. "
"[#7342](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7342)"
msgstr ""
"支持在推测解码中为目标模型和草稿模型分别设置注意力后端，实现更精细的逐模型后端调优。[#7342](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7342)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:822
msgid ""
"Qwen VL models now support `w8a8_mxfp8` quantization. "
"[#7417](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7417)"
msgstr ""
"Qwen VL模型现支持`w8a8_mxfp8`量化。[#7417](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7417)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:826
msgid ""
"Optimized Triton operator recompilation to reduce redundant rebuilds and "
"unnecessary recompilation triggered by function parameter optimization. "
"[#7647](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7647) "
"[#7645](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7645)"
msgstr ""
"优化了Triton算子重编译，减少因函数参数优化触发的冗余重建和不必要重编译。[#7647](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7647) [#7645](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7645)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:827
msgid ""
"Optimized the Qwen3.5 and Qwen3-Next GDN prefill path by prebuilding chunk "
"metadata, reducing host-device synchronization overhead. "
"[#7487](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7487)"
msgstr ""
"通过预构建块元数据优化了Qwen3.5和Qwen3-Next的GDN预填充路径，减少了主机-"
"设备同步开销。[#7487](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7487)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:828
msgid ""
"Simplified the FIA prefill context merge path for better runtime efficiency."
" [#7293](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7293)"
msgstr ""
"简化了FIA预填充上下文合并路径，提升了运行时效率。[#7293](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7293)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:836
msgid ""
"Fixed a PD Disaggregation issue where decode nodes could get stuck because "
"shapes were not aligned across DP nodes. [#7534](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7534)"
msgstr ""
"修复了PD分离中因DP节点间形状未对齐导致解码节点卡住的问题。[#7534](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7534)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:837
msgid ""
"Fixed a regression where hybrid attention plus mamba models on Ascend could "
"start with an incorrect block size after the v0.18.0 upgrade. "
"[#7528](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7528)"
msgstr ""
"修复了v0.18.0升级后，Ascend上混合注意力加mamba模型可能以错误块大小启动的回归问题。[#7528](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7528)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:838
msgid ""
"Fixed multi-instance serving OOM calculation on single-card deployments. "
"[#7427](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7427)"
msgstr ""
"修复了单卡部署中多实例服务的OOM计算问题。[#7427](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7427)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:839
msgid ""
"Fixed DeepSeek v3.1 C8 when overlaying MTP with full decode and full graph "
"modes. [#7571](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/7571)"
msgstr ""
"修复了在完整解码和完整图模式下叠加MTP时DeepSeek v3.1 C8的问题。[#7571](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7571)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:844
msgid ""
"When running DeepSeek-R1 W8A8 with MTP and KV Pool enabled under high "
"concurrency, a `ValueError: Counters can only be incremented by non-negative"
" amounts` may occur. [#7489](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/7489)"
msgstr ""
"在高并发下运行启用了MTP和KV Pool的DeepSeek-R1 W8A8时，可能会出现`ValueError: Counters can only "
"be incremented by non-negative amounts`错误。[#7489](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/issues/7489)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:846
msgid ""
"FIA does not support all MHA head dimensions when using tp-size >= 16 on "
"Ascend. Affected models will fail with an error on unsupported head "
"dimensions. This will be resolved in a future release when FIA supports more"
" head dimensions. [#7729](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/7729)"
msgstr ""
"在Ascend上使用tp-size >= "
"16时，FIA不支持所有MHA头维度。受影响的模型将在不支持的头维度上报错失败。此问题将在未来版本中FIA支持更多头维度时解决。[#7729](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/7729)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:847
#, python-format
msgid ""
"While Minimax-2.5 now supports PD Disaggregation, internal testing has "
"identified a 13% regression on the GPQA benchmark when this feature is "
"enabled. We currently do not recommend enabling PD Disaggregation for this "
"model and We are working on an optimization fix."
msgstr ""
"虽然Minimax-2.5现已支持PD分离，但内部测试发现启用该功能后GPQA基准测试性能下降13%。我们目前不建议为此模型启用PD分离，并正在优化修复中。"

