msgid ""
"Hunyuan OCR doesn't work. We'll fix it in the next release. "
"[#4989](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/4989) "
"[#4992](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/4992)"
