#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1499
msgid ""
"This is the first release candidate of v0.11.0 for vLLM Ascend. Please "
"follow the [official doc](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/v0.11.0) "
"to get started. v0.11.0 will be the next official release version of vLLM "
