" 将是 vLLM Ascend 的下一个正式发布版本。我们将在未来几天内发布。欢迎任何反馈，以帮助我们改进 v0.11.0。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1504
msgid ""
"CANN is upgraded to 8.3.RC1. TorchNPU is upgraded to 2.7.1. "
"[#3945](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/3945) "
"[#3896](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/3896)"
