"ascend/pull/3896)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1505
msgid ""
"PrefixCache and Chunked Prefill are enabled by default. "
"[#3967](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/3967)"
