#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1510
msgid "Performance of Qwen3 and Deepseek V3 series models are improved."
msgstr "Qwen3 和 Deepseek V3 系列模型的性能得到提升。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1511
msgid ""
"Mooncake layerwise connector is supported now "
"[#2602](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/2602). Find "
"tutorial [pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-"
