"[#1224](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/1224)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1983
msgid ""
"Add unit test framework [#1201](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/pull/1201)"
msgstr ""
"新增单元测试框架 [#1201](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/1201)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:1987
msgid ""
"In some cases, the vLLM process may crash with a **GatherV3** error when "
"**aclgraph** is enabled. We are working on this issue and will fix it in the"
" next release. [#1038](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/1038)"
