#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:2210
msgid ""
"Speculative decoding feature is supported. [#252](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/pull/252)"
msgstr "支持推测解码功能。[#252](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/252)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:2211
